    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '2



    Now we are in a shared room, we need to share our coordinate
    system so holograms appear in the same place for all users.


    If you are
    remote from other users, go ahead and click ''Continue'' to place your own local
    origin point.


    If you are in the same physical space as other users you
    can make use of Azure Spatial Anchors to sync coordinates.


    If you need
    to create a new anchor, go ahead and select ''Create Anchor'', and enter a name
    for your anchor. You can then place an anchor object on a horizontal surface
    like a floor or table top.


    If you need to find an anchor, go ahead and
    select ''Find Anchor'', enter the name of the anchor you wish to find and scan
    the room a little in the vicinity of where the anchor should be.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
